      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 35,
      "npc" : "Old Woman",
      "text" : "Nah, I don't care about it"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 37,
      "npc" : "Old Woman",
      "placeholders" : [
        ".@n$"
      ],
      "text" : "{0}\nI believe the item is called a ^FF0000Berzebub Card^000000. It makes you cast spells really fast!"
